msgstr "Aplikácia {productName} sa presunula na {host}. Pridaj si ju na plochu alebo do Docku a potom sa prihlás v tejto aplikácii."

#. Banner in an installed web app on other browsers. productName is the app name. host is the new domain, for example fluxer.com.
