msgstr "Keď ti doručíme pass, pridáme ťa do komunity Fluxer Labs, pokiaľ si z nej predtým neodišiel alebo z nej nebol odstránený. Keď je táto možnosť zapnutá, krátko nato ťa v kanáli #operators privítame menom."

#. Error under the certificate name fields when the server turned a name down, for example because it looks like it comes from Fluxer or another brand, or because it has characters such as emoji that the certificate cannot print. Never say which rule matched.
#: src/features/premium/components/operator_pass/OperatorPassCertificateNamesField.tsx
